 is open daily from dawn to dusk.","source_url":"https://gardens.charlotte.edu/","source_title":"UNC Charlotte Botanical Gardens","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor garden is open daily dawn to dusk. Events and photography sessions may require separate registration and payment.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"van-landingham-glen","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Van Landingham Glen","title":"Take the Glen trails","subtitle":"UNC Charlotte Botanical Gardens","notes":"Follow the wooded garden trails at your own pace, then pause at a bench or picnic table rather than treating the visit as a scheduled program.","short_summary":"A free woodland garden with native Carolina plants and rhododendrons.","evidence_claim":"The Botanical Gardens’ admission is always free, and Van Landingham Glen is open daily from dawn to dusk.","source_url":"https://gardens.charlotte.edu/","source_title":"UNC Charlotte Botanical Gardens","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor garden is open daily dawn to dusk; stay on established trails and plan around daylight.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mellichamp-native-terrace","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Mellichamp Native Terrace","title":"Explore the Native Terrace","subtitle":"Inside Susie Harwood Garden, UNC Charlotte Botanical Gardens","notes":"Make the terrace a shared plant-spotting stop: follow its meadow and hardscaping, then compare which native blooms or textures catch your attention.","short_summary":"A named native-plant collection within the free Botanical Gardens.","evidence_claim":"Mellichamp Native Terrace is an addition to the Susie Harwood Garden, and admission to the Botanical Gardens is always free.","sourc